WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
If you are spending your business cash flow on these things,

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:04.820
then I want you to stop because you are wasting your money.

00:00:04.821 --> 00:00:05.500
And right now

00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:09.340
I am trying to be radically transparent with the business advice that I give

00:00:09.341 --> 00:00:13.020
simply because of what I've gone through and all the mistakes that I've made.

00:00:13.021 --> 00:00:14.700
Now the more you know. So

00:00:14.701 --> 00:00:17.700
the first piece of advice that I would give to business owners

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:21.660
is to stop talking about being a 6 or seven figure business owner

00:00:21.661 --> 00:00:23.820
and trying to look bigger than you actually are.

00:00:23.821 --> 00:00:26.980
Because the only thing this actually does is disappoint yourself

00:00:26.981 --> 00:00:28.020
because you know

00:00:28.021 --> 00:00:31.500
the gap between where you actually are and what you are portraying to the world.

00:00:31.501 --> 00:00:33.360
And what it also does is

00:00:33.361 --> 00:00:36.100
make you spend money on things to try and make you look bigger.

00:00:36.101 --> 00:00:38.020
You'll sponsor events, you'll hire a P R.

00:00:38.021 --> 00:00:42.500
Agency and you'll try and get into articles to show how big your business is.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:46.700
The second thing I would advise is to get rid of your marketing agency.

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:49.820
Business owners say that learning ads is overwhelming.

00:00:49.821 --> 00:00:53.540
My advice is to spend an entire day watching YouTube videos

00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:55.620
and learning how to do it from scratch.

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:59.820
A 20 year old at a marketing agency can learn how to do your ads,

00:00:59.821 --> 00:01:00.900
then why can't you?

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:04.740
And the last thing is to stop simply accepting your supplier terms.

00:01:04.741 --> 00:01:08.740
Everything can be negotiated from your payment terms to how many pieces you need

00:01:08.741 --> 00:01:11.220
To buy, stick to the lowest possible m o q,

00:01:11.221 --> 00:01:12.860
and even negotiate that down.

00:01:12.861 --> 00:01:17.300
Because while a lower stock run can mean less margin initially,

00:01:17.301 --> 00:01:20.820
you could be left with a lot of pieces that will never sell,

00:01:20.821 --> 00:01:22.700
and that is a cash flow disaster.

00:01:22.701 --> 00:01:23.820
By doing these three things,

00:01:23.821 --> 00:01:27.486
you are going to save yourself a lot of time, energy and money.
